  "subject": "a young migratory beekeeper who trucks forty hives into a Dongshan longan orchard for the April blossom and courts the owner's daughter while she walks the rows with him in the midday heat; she laughs at his veil, binds a sting on his wrist with her handkerchief, dips her finger into the first frame of longan honey before her father can, and asks him to bring the bees back next April",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Bollywood filmi romance in the modern Hindi film-soundtrack style. A sitar melody over a tanpura drone; tabla on a gentle keherwa groove; harmonium swells; a lush Bollywood string section answering each vocal phrase; bansuri flute fills. Lush, polished film-soundtrack mix with wide strings and a close, warm vocal. A warm, smooth male tenor with light filmi ornaments and gentle melisma, intimate and earnest. 86 BPM, A major. Tender, shy and warm, sunlit. No trap drums, no autotune, no EDM drop, no rap verse, no Western pop-ballad piano, no bhangra dhol.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n四月 東山的龍眼花開\n我載四十箱蜂 來你兜的園\n你阿爸講 園仔大 會揣無路\n叫你 𤆬我行一輪\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你戴笠仔 我戴網仔\n你笑我 若像欲去娶某\n\n[Chorus]\n龍眼花 一欉一欉白\n蜂仔 嗡嗡咧唱歌\n日頭 曝甲頭殼燒燒\n我毋敢看你 干焦看花\n\n[Verse]\n中晝 我掀開第三箱\n一隻蜂 叮佇我的手腕\n你走過來 提出你的手巾仔\n共我縛甲 若像一粒肉粽\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你講 疼就喝出來\n我講 無疼 喙煞咧顫\n\n[Chorus]\n龍眼花 一欉一欉白\n蜂仔 嗡嗡咧唱歌\n你縛的彼條手巾仔\n我歸禮拜 毋甘解\n\n[Verse]\n花謝矣 蜜嘛飽矣\n我捧頭一框蜜 出來\n你阿爸猶未開喙\n你的指頭仔 先點落去\n\n[Bridge]\n你舐一下 目睭瞇瞇\n你講 這是阮兜的花\n愛閣甜 就愛閣來\n\n[Chorus]\n明年 龍眼花閣開的時\n你講 蜂仔愛閣載來\n我講 蜂仔會來\n我嘛會來\n\n[Outro]\n手巾仔 猶縛佇我的手",
